<Slide notes={`Every number here is measured, not projected. Building memory for one conversation takes 1,311 calls — against 398 to answer all 199 questions. Remove the mechanism and the write path drops from 1,311 calls to 419 — eleven times cheaper. And it inflates the read path too: 11,910 input tokens per question against 1,508 without evolution. Total spend: fourteen point eight yuan, about two dollars, for roughly 6,300 calls.`} style={{ padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Arial' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 64, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ color: '#FFFFFF', fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', marginLeft: 60 }}>What the mechanism costs</Text>
    <Text style={{ color: '#B8C7E6', fontSize: 16, marginLeft: 'auto', marginRight: 60 }}>FTEC5660 · Reproducibility</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 676, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ color: '#8B97A8', fontSize: 14 }}>Reproducing A-MEM on LoCoMo</Text>
    <Text style={{ color: '#8B97A8', fontSize: 14 }}>14 / 16</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 64, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 606, flexDirection: 'column', paddingTop: 32, paddingBottom: 40 }}>
    <Table
      style={{ width: '100%', height: 330 }}
      defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 16, textAlign: 'left', color: '#1A2230' }}
      defaultCellStyle={{ border: { bottom: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' } } }}
      cells={[
        [
          { text: 'Phase', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
          { text: 'Calls', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8', textAlign: 'right' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
          { text: 'Input tokens', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8', textAlign: 'right' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
          { text: 'Est. cost', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8', textAlign: 'right' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
          { text: 'Wall clock', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8', textAlign: 'right' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
        ],
        ['Baseline: memory build', { text: '1,311', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '2.0 M', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '$0.375', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '28 min', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }],
        ['Baseline: answering', { text: '398 / trial', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '2.37 M', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '$0.67', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '6.6 min', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }],
        [{ text: 'No-evolution: memory build', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } }, { text: '419', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } }, { text: '0.34 M', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } }, { text: '$0.033', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } }, { text: '7 min', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } }],
        ['Baseline at k=40: answering', { text: '398 / trial', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '9.60 M', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '$2.69', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '11.5 min', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }],
      ]}
    />
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32, marginTop: 30 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ color: '#1E4FA8', fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1, marginBottom: 10 }}>THE READ PATH IS INFLATED TOO</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ color: '#1A2230', fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1 }}>11,910</Text>
          <Text style={{ color: '#8B97A8', fontSize: 22 }}>vs 1,508 tokens / question</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ color: '#4A5568', fontSize: 18, lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>7.9× — the ten retrieved notes drag their neighbours into the prompt.</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ color: '#1E4FA8', fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1, marginBottom: 10 }}>TOTAL SPEND</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ color: '#1A2230', fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1 }}>CNY 14.8</Text>
          <Text style={{ color: '#8B97A8', fontSize: 22 }}>≈ $2.1</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ color: '#4A5568', fontSize: 18, lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>≈ 6,300 calls, including one discarded build.</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
